# Streamlining (aggressive cleanup pass):
#   - yfinance TTL cache (60s): all 75 yf.Ticker() + 2 yf.download() calls route through
#     _yf_ticker()/_yf_download(); _CachedTicker caches history/option_chain/options/
#     calendar/info/fast_info. Repeated same-symbol fetches in one handler are deduped.
#     history()/download() return a defensive .copy() so callers can't corrupt the cache.
#   - db() context manager (always closes the SQLite connection).
